server/thread.c thread QoS options in one patch (regenerated 2026-10-24 from the live tree on top of 0011): WINE_MAINTHRD_QOS,
WINE_JOBTHRD_QOS and the e-core thread legacy-policy skip. Replaces the old 0015 (corrupt), 0017 and 0019 (no longer applied
in sequence); originals in superseded/. 0016 (alert fast path) is deliberately not in the tree: superseded/ too.

--- a/server/thread.c
+++ b/server/thread.c
